<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Tasks on Best of AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tags/tasks/</link><description>Recent content in Tasks on Best of AI</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bestofai.io/tags/tasks/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Zetik</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/zetik/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/zetik/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Zetik positions itself as a personal intelligence staffer: it monitors podcasts, academic papers, code activity, social posts, and news for the subjects a user tells it to track, then compresses everything into a short brief instead of leaving the user to hunt through separate feeds. The pitch is similar to how an executive relies on staff to stay current, applied to an individual&amp;rsquo;s own interests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The product launched on Product Hunt in August 2026 and climbed to the top of the daily leaderboard within its first two weeks. Its makers have said Claude Code was central to building it, taking the project from prototype to a shipped product quickly with a small team.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Elastic AI Assistant</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/elastic-ai-assistant/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/elastic-ai-assistant/</guid><description/></item><item><title>AIPRM</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/aiprm/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/aiprm/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Amplenote</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/amplenote/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/amplenote/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Asana</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/asana-pm/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/asana-pm/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Asana</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/asana/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/asana/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Brave Leo</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/brave-leo/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/brave-leo/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Clickup</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/clickup/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/clickup/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Coda AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/coda-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/coda-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Craft Docs</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/craft-docs/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 